<title>USA: Ribozyme Pharmaceutical in pact.</title>
<headline>Ribozyme Pharmaceutical in pact.</headline>
<dateline>BOULDER, Colo. 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ribozyme Pharmaceuticals Inc and Protogene Laboratories Inc Wednesday announced plans to collaborate on the synthesis, deprotection and purification of large numbers of modified ribozymes and other molecules.</p>
<p>As part of the collaboration, Ribozyme said it will fund research and purchase shares of Series A Preferred Stock of Protogene. Terms of the deal were not disclosed.</p>
</text>
